{"results": [{"name": "Noom.", "entity_id": "E5FFF0AE-2EEA-4F0F-888D-12C618866C30", "types": ["urn:entity:brand"], "properties": {"akas": [], "description": "A digital health platform that utilizes cognitive behavioral therapy and evidence-based science to help users achieve sustainable health and weight management goals. By combining personalized coaching, AI-driven guidance, and clinical support, the service facilitates lasting habit changes rather than temporary fixes. The brand has evolved from a weight-loss focused tool into a broader behavior change platform addressing diabetes, menopause, and overall preventive health. It targets health-conscious adults who prioritize long-term, medically backed results and digital integration for their wellness journey.", "external": {"instagram": {"id": "noom.official"}}, "founded_year": "2008", "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/E5FFF0AE-2EEA-4F0F-888D-12C618866C30-420x-auto.jpg"}, "short_description": "Noom is a health and wellness brand offering AI and human-led coaching for weight loss and lifestyle changes, plus a woman-owned sex-wellness product line.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "de", "value": "Eine psychologiebasierte Plattform mit personalisiertem Coaching, KI-Tools und medizinischer Unterstützung für nachhaltige Gewichtsabnahme und einen gesunden Lebensstil."}, {"language": "en", "value": "A psychology-based platform offering personalized health coaching, AI tools, and medical support to help users achieve sustainable weight loss and lifestyle improvement."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Una plataforma basada en psicología que ofrece coaching, herramientas de IA y apoyo médico para ayudar a los usuarios a lograr una pérdida de peso sostenible y mejoras en su estilo de vida."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Une plateforme basée sur la psychologie offrant un coaching personnalisé, des outils d'IA et un soutien médical pour une perte de poids durable et une amélioration du mode de vie."}]}, "populari